 "早": "قَد, مِنْ قَبْلُ (Prior to some specified time, either past, present, or future; by this time; pre) / لقد (So soon.)  [already] / سَرِيع (Moving with speed, rapidity or swiftness, or capable of doing so; rapid; fast.) / سَرِيعٌ (Occurring in a short time; happening or done rapidly.) / حَيٌّ (Alive, living.) / جَارٍ (Pregnant, especially at the stage where the foetus's movements can be felt; figu) / سَرِيعًا, بِسُرْعَةٍ (Quickly, in a quick manner.)  [quick]\nمثال: 早熟れの早腐り。\n→ Soon ripe, soon rotten.",
