 "是非もない": "وَاجِب (Impossible to avoid; bound to happen.)  [unavoidable]",
 "是非もなし": "لَا مَفَرّ, لَا أَسْتَطِيع ذٰلِك (It is inevitable. There is no alternative.)  [it can't be helped]",
 "是非も無い": "وَاجِب (Impossible to avoid; bound to happen.)  [unavoidable]",
 "是非も無し": "لَا مَفَرّ, لَا أَسْتَطِيع ذٰلِك (It is inevitable. There is no alternative.)  [it can't be helped]",
 "是非共": "بِأَيِّ ثَمَنٍ (As an absolute imperative; sparing no effort or expense)  [at all costs]\nمثال: あなたの迅速な返事が是非とも必要です。\n→ Your prompt reply is urgently required.",
 "是非是非": "بِالتَّأْكِيد (In a way which is certain; with certainty.) / بِالتَّأْكِيد, بِدُون شَكّ (Without doubt, surely.) / بِالتَّأْكِيد, بِدُون شَكّ (An emphatic affirmative answer; of course.)  [certainly]",
 "是非無い": "وَاجِب (Impossible to avoid; bound to happen.)  [unavoidable]",
