 "昼": "ظهر, ظَهِيرَة (The time of day when the Sun seems to reach its highest point in the sky; solar )  [noon]\nمثال: ケンは昼まで家にいるでしょう。\n→ Ken will be at home until noon. / نَهَارُ (The time of daylight; the time between sunrise and sunset.)  [daytime]\nمثال: 私は昼も夜も彼女のことを考えている。\n→ I think of her day and night. / غَدَاء (A light meal usually eaten around midday, notably when not as main meal of the d)  [lunch]\nمثال: 昼はホットドッグを食べたんだ。\n→ I ate a hot dog for lunch.",
 "昼ごはん": "غَدَاء (A light meal usually eaten around midday, notably when not as main meal of the d)  [lunch]\nمثال: 昼ご飯を食べに外に出ませんか。\n→ How about going out for lunch?",
 "昼ご飯": "غَدَاء (A light meal usually eaten around midday, notably when not as main meal of the d)  [lunch]\nمثال: 昼ご飯を食べに外に出ませんか。\n→ How about going out for lunch?",
 "昼すぎ": "بَعْد الظُّهْر, بَعْدَ الزَّوَال (The part of the day from noon or lunchtime until sunset, evening, or suppertime )  [afternoon]\nمثال: 昼過ぎからはちょっと忙しくなるんだ。\n→ I have rather a busy afternoon in front of me.",
