 "昼前": "صَبَاح (part of the day between dawn and midday) / غُدْوة (part of the day between dawn and midday) / صُبْح (part of the day between dawn and midday) / صباح (part of the day between dawn and midday) / صُبُح (part of the day between dawn and midday) / صباح (part of the day between dawn and midday)  [morning]\nمثال: 郵便は昼前に来る。\n→ The mail arrives before noon. / [just before noon]",
 "昼夜": "لَيْلَ نَهَارَ, صَبَاحَ مَسَاءَ (All the time; round the clock; unceasingly.)  [day and night]\nمثال: 警察が墜落事故の原因を昼夜休むことなく調査している。\n→ The police are investigating the cause of the crash around the clock.",
