 "昼間": "نَهَارُ (The time of daylight; the time between sunrise and sunset.)  [daytime]\nمثال: 太陽は昼間輝く。\n→ The sun shines during the day.",
 "昼食": "غَدَاء (A light meal usually eaten around midday, notably when not as main meal of the d)  [lunch]\nمثال: 今日は昼食をとる時間がない。\n→ I don't have enough time to eat lunch today.",
 "昼飯": "غَدَاء (A light meal usually eaten around midday, notably when not as main meal of the d)  [lunch]\nمثال: 昼飯でもいっしょにどうですか。\n→ Why don't we have lunch together?",
