 "時": "وَقْت (A duration of time.) / مَرَّة, مرة (An instant of time.) / وَقْت (An instant of time.) / حِين, وَقْت (A ratio of comparison (see also usage notes and prepositional sense at 'times').)  [time]\n刻 signifies a time of day; 秋 signifies an important time\nمثال: １２才の時彼は声変わりした。\n→ His voice broke when he was twelve. / فُرْصَة, مُنَاسَبَة (A favorable opportunity; a convenient or timely chance.) / مُنَاسَبَة (A particular happening; an instance or time when something occurred.)  [occasion]\nمثال: 車を運転する時はいくら注意してもしすぎることはない。\n→ You cannot be too careful when you drive a car. / فُرْصَة (An opportunity or possibility.)  [chance] / فِي (Multiplied by (see also 'ratio of comparison' sense at 'time').)  [the times]",
 "時々": "أَحْيَانًا, سَاعَات (On some occasions, over some periods, or in certain circumstances, but not alway)  [sometimes]\nمثال: ジェーンはときどき学校まで走っていく。\n→ Jane sometimes runs to school. / مُنَاسِب (Suitable or fit; proper; felicitous.) / لَائِق (Suitable to the social situation or to social respect or social discreetness; so)  [appropriate (for the season or occasion)]",
 "時おり": "أَحْيَانًا, سَاعَات (On some occasions, over some periods, or in certain circumstances, but not alway)  [sometimes]\nمثال: 私は時おり学校で彼に会う。\n→ I meet him at school now and then.",
 "時が解決する": "الزَّمَن يُعَالِجُ كُل الأَجْرَاح (Negative feelings eventually fade away.)  [time heals all wounds]",
 "時たま": "أَحْيَانًا (On occasion: at relatively infrequent intervals, from time to time, sometimes.)  [occasionally]\nمثال: ときたま彼から便りがあります。\n→ I hear from him once in a while.",
 "時として": "أَحْيَانًا, سَاعَات (On some occasions, over some periods, or in certain circumstances, but not alway)  [sometimes]\nمثال: 天才は時として態度が粗野なことがある。\n→ A genius can sometimes have rude manners.",
 "時ならぬ": "مُفَاجِئ (Not expected, anticipated or foreseen.)  [unexpected]\nمثال: 「冬のソナタ」を例に挙げるまでもなく、いまや時ならぬ韓流ブームである。\n→ You don't need to bring up \"A Winter Sonata\" to show that South Korean culture is having an unexpected boom in Japan.",
 "時に": "بِالْمُنَاسَبَةِ, عَلَى فِكْرَةٍ (Incidentally; used in referencing a parenthetical statement not timely, central,)  [by the way]\nمثال: 時に鈴木の件について聞いたか。\n→ By the way, have you heard about Suzuki? / أَحْيَانًا, سَاعَات (On some occasions, over some periods, or in certain circumstances, but not alway)  [sometimes]\nمثال: 犯罪は時に法律を知らないために引き起こされる。\n→ Crimes sometimes result from ignorance of the law. / بِدِقَّة (In a precise manner; exactly.)  [precisely (at that time)]",
 "時には": "أَحْيَانًا (On occasion, sometimes.)  [at times]\nمثال: ときには試合は一日中続きました。\n→ Sometimes the game lasted all day.",
