 "時の運": "فُرْصَة (An opportunity or possibility.)  [(a matter of) chance]",
 "時は金なり": "اَلْوَقْتُ مِنْ ذَهَبٍ (Money is wasted (in lost wages, missed opportunities, etc.) when a person's time)  [time is money]\nمثال: 時は金なりとは至言である。\n→ It is truly said that time is money.",
