 "時候": "مَوْسِم (A year, but with emphasis on the most important part of the year in context, suc) / مَوْسِم, جُزْء (A group of episodes of a television or radio program broadcast in regular interv)  [season]",
 "時分": "وَقْت (A duration of time.) / مَرَّة, مرة (An instant of time.) / وَقْت (An instant of time.) / حِين, وَقْت (A ratio of comparison (see also usage notes and prepositional sense at 'times').)  [time]\nمثال: 彼は若い時分にはバイオリンを弾いていた。\n→ He used to play the violin in his youth. / فُرْصَة (A chance for advancement, progress or profit.)  [opportunity]",
