 "暗誦": "تِلَاوَة (The act of publicly reciting something previously memorized.)  [recitation]\nمثال: 私はその話を暗唱することができた。\n→ I could recite the story by heart.",
 "暗転": "غَشْيَة (A temporary loss of consciousness.) / تَعْتِيم (The mandatory blocking of all light emanating from buildings, as well as outdoor)  [(theatrical) blackout] / [taking a (sudden) turn for the worse ; rapid deterioration]",
