 "替え": "تَغَيَّرَƒ (To become something different.) / غَيَّرَ (To make something into something else.) / تَغْيِير, تَبْدِيل (The process or result of becoming different.) / فَكَّة (Small denominations of money given in exchange for a larger denomination.) / بَاقٍ (Balance of money returned from the sum paid after deducting the price of a purch) / تَغْيِير (A transfer between vehicles.)  [change]\nمثال: シャツの替えがない。\n→ I don't have a spare shirt. / اِسْتَبْدَلَ (to use in place of something else)  [substitute] / [rate of exchange]\nusu. 換え",
