 "月下推敲": "بُولَنْدِيّ, بُولَنْدِيّ (Of, from or native to Poland, or relating to the Polish language.) / لَمَّعَ (To shine; to make a surface very smooth or shiny by rubbing, cleaning, or grindi) / صَقَل (To refine; remove imperfections from.)  [polish]",
