 "未知": "مَجْهُول, مُبْهَم (Not known; unidentified; not well known.) / مُتَغَيِّر (A variable (usually x, y or z) whose value is to be found.) / غَامِض, غَوَامِض (Any thing, place, or situation about which nothing is known; an unknown fact or ) / مَجْهُول, مُبْهَم (A person of no identity; a nonentity.)  [unknown]\nمثال: ソフイーは未知の差し出し人からまた手紙が来るのを心待ちにしていた。\n→ Sophie had been looking forward to getting another letter from the unknown sender.",
