 "末に": "أَخِيراً (At the end or conclusion; ultimately.)  [finally]\nused after long, hard work\nمثال: ジョージは、最近３時間の格闘の末に釣った、重さ３０ポンドのバスの話をしていた。\n→ George was describing a 30 pound bass he'd caught recently after fighting it for three hours. / [at the end (of)]\nwith noun, e.g. 来週の末に",
 "末の末": "آخِر (Final, ultimate, coming after all others of its kind.) / مَاضٍ, الْمَاضِي (Most recent, latest, last so far.) / آخر (after everything else; finally) / اِسْتَمَرَّ, دَامَ (To endure, continue over time.)  [the last]",
