 "本則": "قَانُون, قَاعِدَة (A regulation, law, guideline.) / حُكْم, حُكُومَة (The act of ruling; administration of law; government; empire; authority; control) / حَكَمَ (To regulate, be in charge of, make decisions for, reign over.)  [rules]",
