 "本命": "مُفَضَّل (Liked, cherished.)  [favourite]\nمثال: 本命と対抗馬が競り合ったお陰で、ダークホースの彼が漁夫の利を得たってわけだ。\n→ Since the favorite and his rival were running against each other a dark horse like him was able to pull out in front. / [one's heart's desire ; first choice] / [chocolate given to a man on Valentine's day out of genuine sentiment]",
