 "本国": "وَطَن, مَوْطِن (The country in which a person was born and usually raised, regardless of the pre)  [home country]\nمثال: 彼の音楽は本国では人気がなかった。\n→ His music was not popular at home. / [suzerain country (from the perspective of the vassal state) ; colonizing country] / [country of one's ancestors] / [this country]",
