 "極度": "الْأُقْصَى, الْأَبْعَد (Of a place, the most remote, farthest or outermost.) / شَدِيد (In the greatest or highest degree; intense.) / غَيْر اِعْتِيَادِيّ (Excessive, or far beyond the norm.) / خَطِير (Drastic, or of great severity.) / مُتَطَرِّف (Of sports, difficult or dangerous; performed in a hazardous environment.) / أَخِير (Ultimate, final or last.)  [extreme]\nمثال: 人間も極度に寒い温度に対しては、防御装置を備えている。\n→ Man, too, has been given protective devices against extreme temperatures.",
