 "標記": "دَرَجَة (Score, grade, or related judgement.) / أَشَّرَ (To indicate (something) in writing or by other symbols.)  [marking] / فَاعِل, مُبْتَدَأ (The noun, pronoun or noun phrase about whom the statement is made. In active cla) / مَوْضُوع (The main topic of a paper, work of art, discussion, field of study, etc.) / دَوْرَة, مَادَّة (A particular area of study.) / رَعِيَّة (A citizen in a monarchy.)  [subject (of memo, email, etc.)]",
