 "標識": "لافِتَة (A clearly visible object, generally flat, bearing a short message in words or pi) / وَقَّعَ (To make a mark)  [sign]\nمثال: 彼らはその標識を壁に取り付けた。\n→ They fixed the sign to the wall. / [marker]",
