 "模す": "قَلَّدَ (To follow as a model or a pattern; to make a copy, counterpart or semblance of.)  [to imitate] / أَثَر (A mark left as a sign of passage of a person or animal.) / لِوْحَة دَارَاتُ مَطَبُوعَة (A current-carrying conductive pathway on a printed circuit board.)  [to trace]",
 "模する": "قَلَّدَ (To follow as a model or a pattern; to make a copy, counterpart or semblance of.)  [to imitate] / أَثَر (A mark left as a sign of passage of a person or animal.) / لِوْحَة دَارَاتُ مَطَبُوعَة (A current-carrying conductive pathway on a printed circuit board.)  [to trace]",
 "模る": "[to model (something) on ; to be modelled on]\nمثال: 神は自らにかたどって人を創造された。\n→ God created man in his own image. / مَثَّلَ (To stand or act in the place of; to perform the duties, exercise the rights, or )  [to represent]",
