 "模倣": "تَقْلِيد (The act of imitating.)  [imitation]\nمثال: 全ての子供には、尊敬し模倣する人が必要だ。\n→ Every child needs someone to look up to and copy.",
 "模倣品": "تَقْلِيد (The act of imitating.)  [imitation]",
 "模写": "نُسْخَة (result of copying) / اِنْتَسَخَ, نَسَخَ (To produce an object identical to a given object.)  [copy (of the real thing)]\nمثال: 彼はゴッホの模写をした。\n→ He imitated the works of Van Gogh.",
 "模刻": "نُشْخَة (An exact copy.)  [(carved) replica]",
 "模型": "نَمُوذَج (A representation of a physical object.) / نَمُوذَج مُصَغَّر (A simulation used to analyze the workings of a real world system or event.) / نَمُوذَج (A style, type, or design.) / نَمُوذَج (The structural design of a complex system.) / قَدْوَة (A successful example to be copied, with or without modifications.)  [model]\nمثال: 父は私に船の模型を作ってくれた。\n→ Father made me a model of a ship.",
