 "模様": "نُمُوذَج, نَمَط (Model, example.)  [pattern]\nمثال: 彼女はその皿の模様が気に入っている。\n→ She likes the design on the plate. / وَضْع (A condition; a set of circumstances applying at any given time.) / دَوْلَة (A polity or community.) / وِلَايَة (A polity or community.) / يُبْدِي (To make known.)  [state] / [conjecture of the current situation ; the way it seems] / نَمُوذَج (A representation of a physical object.) / نَمُوذَج مُصَغَّر (A simulation used to analyze the workings of a real world system or event.) / نَمُوذَج (A style, type, or design.) / نَمُوذَج (The structural design of a complex system.) / قَدْوَة (A successful example to be copied, with or without modifications.)  [model]",
