 "権": "يَمِين, يمين (Clockwise, particularly when describing a change in direction or orientation.) / صَحِيح, صَوَاب (Complying with justice, correctness, or reason; correct, just, true. See also th) / قَائِم (Of an angle, measuring 90 degrees, or one quarter of a complete rotation; the an) / عَلَى اَلْيَمِين (On the right side.) / إِلَى اَلْيَمِين (Towards the right side.) / صحيح, تمام (Yes, that is correct; I agree.) / حَقّ, حُقُوق (A legal, just or moral entitlement.) / يَمِين (A wave breaking from right to left (viewed from the shore).) / صَحَّحَ (To correct.)  [right (to do something)]\nمثال: 息子は二人とも王位継承権があると主張した。\n→ Both sons pretended to the throne. / سُلْطَة (Power or right to make or enforce rules, give orders, or impose obligation; or a)  [authority]",
 "権兵衛": "فُلان, فُلان الْفُلانِيّ (Any unknown or anonymous, usually male, person.)  [John Doe] / شَخْص رِيفِيّ أَحْمَق (An unsophisticated person from the rural area of a particular country.)  [country bumpkin]",
