 "権威": "سُلْطَة (Power or right to make or enforce rules, give orders, or impose obligation; or a)  [authority]\nمثال: 学生たちは権威に反抗した。\n→ The students revolted against authority. / سُلْطَة (Power or right to make or enforce rules, give orders, or impose obligation; or a)  [(an) authority (on)]\nمثال: その教授はシェイクスピアの権威である。\n→ That professor is an authority on Shakespeare.",
