 "止め処": "نِهَايَة, غَايَة (The most extreme point of an object, especially one that is longer than it is wi) / غَايَة (A purpose, goal, or aim.) / اِنْتَهَى, أَنْهَى (To finish, terminate.)  [end]\nمثال: 彼女はいったん話し始めると止めどがない。\n→ Once she starts talking, she is hard to stop.",
