 "毎度": "كُلَّمَا (At each occasion that.)  [every time]\nمثال: 毎度ごひいきにありがとうございます。\n→ Thank you for your patronage. / [thank you for your continued patronage ; thank you for your support]\nusu. to (regular) customers entering or leaving\nمثال: 毎度、またいらっしゃい。\n→ Thanks, please come again. / آلُو, آلُوْ (A greeting used when answering the telephone.) / هَل مِن أَحَدٍ هُنَا؟ (A call for response if it is not clear if anyone is present or listening, or if )  [hello]\nwhen visiting another person's home; Hokuriku dialect",
