 "毎日": "يَوْمِيّ (That occurs or attends every day, or at least every working day.) / يَوْمِيًّا, كُلَّ يَوْمٍ (quotidianly, every day)  [daily]\nمثال: その犬に毎日食べ物をやって下さい。\n→ Please feed the dog every day.",
