 "毒": "سُمّ, سَمّ (A substance that is harmful or lethal to a living organism when ingested.) / سَمَّمَ, سَمَّ (To use poison to kill or paralyse (somebody).)  [poison]\nمثال: この魚は毒がない。\n→ This fish is free from poison. / ضَرَرٌ (Physical injury; hurt; damage.) / ضَرَّ أَضَرَّ (To damage, hurt, or injure something, usually an inanimate object.)  [harm] / حِقْد (Intention to harm or deprive in an illegal or immoral way. Desire to take pleasu)  [malice] / [abusive language]",
